data: {"id": "0cc4f9b3c30c4cc0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1701", "run_id": "0cc4f9b3c30c4cc0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已收到首轮可观测性 baseline，事实已足够支撑后续 Kubernetes 配置/事件/日志验证。先总结 baseline 关键事实，再执行 plan 中剩余的 Kubernetes 工具。\n\n---\n\n### Baseline 事实摘要（Metrics / Logging / Tracing）\n\n1. **Metrics (Prometheus)**\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = `CrashLoopBackOff` (container=app)\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = **5** (container=app, uid=52361280-45fe-4ec1-a8f0-292e82b90b8c)\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` = `Error` (非 OOMKilled)\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase` 存在 Running=1", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788444258037, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

